    {
      "claim": "The trip record's actual_distance_km of 21.20 is not independent corroboration within POL-RD-07(ii). The admissibility note on EV-TRIP-00110 records that the figure is itself derived from the impaired trace and adds no independent evidence of distance, and the fare ledger's distance_charged_km is 21.20 as well. Two copies of one impaired measurement are not a second measurement, and the billed distance is expressly excluded as corroboration where it is a copy of the trace figure.",
