      "claim": "The rider carries the initial burden under POL-RD-08 and must show an excess meeting the POL-RD-01 threshold measured from an unimpaired gps_trace or, where the trace is impaired under POL-RD-07(a) to (c), from an independent source named in POL-RD-07(ii). The trace is impaired - a 428.0 s gap and coverage of 81.7% - and no source in POL-RD-07(ii)'s list exists on this record. The second limb of the rider's burden is therefore not discharged and the driver is never put to an exculpatory clause at all.",
